# theme.fth — the project palette.
#
# Only what differs from the compiled-in default in ui_theme.go is written, so
# this file is a list of decisions rather than a dump of every colour in the
# engine. Deleting a line puts that colour back to the default; deleting the
# file puts all of them back.
#
# font names a .ttf in resources/fonts. Left blank until one is chosen, which
# makes every label render in the built-in bitmap face — deliberately crude, so
# a missing font reads as missing rather than as a rendering bug.
font: ""
